::ILANG
[TYPE:config][PROJECT:vps-deals][LANG:zh]
::STATE{@SITE, "brand":"VPS Deals", "niche":"VPS hosting", "domain":"https://vpsdealradar.com", "locale":"en-US", "currency":"USD", "repository":"https://github.com/siliconwoke28-afk/vps-deals-promo-radar"}
::MODULE{PROVIDERS|title:抓哪几家 这里改了站就变}
# 名称 | 官网 | 官方价格或优惠页 | 获批的联盟链接（未批准留空）
Hostinger | https://www.hostinger.com/ | https://www.hostinger.com/vps-hosting |
IONOS | https://www.ionos.com/ | https://www.ionos.com/servers/vps |
OVHcloud | https://us.ovhcloud.com/ | https://us.ovhcloud.com/vps/ |
Hetzner | https://www.hetzner.com/ | https://www.hetzner.com/cloud/ |
