DigitalOcean | https://www.digitalocean.com/ | https://www.digitalocean.com/pricing/droplets |
Akamai Linode | https://www.linode.com/ | https://www.linode.com/lp/free-credit-100/ |
::MODULE{FIELDS|title:每条优惠提取什么}
title price currency offer_url valid_until source_url fetched_at
::MODULE{RENDER|title:渲染和更新规则}
::POLICY{"cron":"17 */6 * * *","max_age_hours":36,"timeout_seconds":25,"max_bytes":6000000,"user_agent":"VPSDealsBot/1.0","render":["index","provider","deal","compare"],"sort":"provider","allow_unpriced":false}
# EXTRACT 是 JSON 参数的 I-Lang 指令；pattern 使用命名捕获组。无匹配即不发布。价格必须源自 price 捕获组。
::EXTRACT{"provider":"hostinger","kind":"promotion","pattern":"(?P<discount>\\d+)% off (?P<title>KVM \\d+) \\$ (?P<original>\\d+\\.\\d+) \\$ (?P<price>\\d+\\.\\d+) /mo Choose plan (?P<terms>Renews at \\$(?P<renewal>\\d+\\.\\d+)/mo for \\d+ years\\. Cancel anytime\\.) (?P<cpu>\\d+) vCPU cores? (?P<ram>\\d+) GB RAM (?P<storage>\\d+) GB NVMe disk space","currency":"USD","billing":"month","price_label":"Advertised monthly equivalent","note":"Introductory rate; upfront term and total payment must be confirmed at checkout. The displayed discount is the provider's claim, not a calculated lifetime saving."}
::EXTRACT{"provider":"ionos","kind":"promotion","pattern":"(?P<title>VPS [A-Z]+\\+) Save (?P<discount>\\d+)% \\$(?P<original>\\d+) \\$ (?P<price>\\d+) /month (?P<terms>for \\d+ months with a \\d+-year term) (?P<cpu>\\d+) vCores? CPU (?P<ram>\\d+) GB RAM (?P<storage>\\d+) GB NVMe","currency":"USD","billing":"month","price_label":"Introductory monthly rate","note":"Provider-displayed saving applies to its stated offer terms, not necessarily the first-month price difference. Confirm subsequent charges and total contract cost at checkout; taxes may apply."}
::EXTRACT{"provider":"ovhcloud","kind":"standard","pattern":"(?P<title>VPS-\\d+) Starting at \\$(?P<price>\\d+\\.\\d+) :?/month Configure (?P<cpu>\\d+) vCores? (?P<ram>\\d+) GB RAM (?P<storage>\\d+) GB SSD NVMe","currency":"USD","billing":"month","price_label":"Starting monthly price","note":"Standard advertised starting rate, not a verified discount. Region, term, taxes and optional services can change the checkout total."}
::RULE{抓不到 price⇒不发布价格 不写 Offer 价格字段 不许估算}
::RULE{valid_until 已过⇒下架; 来源失败⇒从当前目录撤下 不把旧价格重新标为已验证}
::RULE{尊重 robots.txt; HTTP 403/429 或 TLS 失败⇒停止该来源 不绕过}
::RULE{只允许官方来源; 联盟链接为空⇒裸链; 有联盟链接⇒sponsored 披露}
::RULE{页面:首页 厂商 详情 对比; 元数据由可溯源字段生成; sitemap使用真实采集时间}
::BOUNDARY{never:编优惠 编价格 编佣金 编到期日 绕反爬 刷量 cookie注入 品牌词竞价 自买自推|scope:permanent}

